From: Ayoub Zaki <ayoub.zaki@embetrix.com>
Subject: [PATCH] Do not require Cython for the pure Python build

The recipe sets SKIP_CYTHON=1 to use the supported Python implementation.
Remove the unconditional accelerator dependency so PEP 517 validation can
build that configuration without Cython.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [configuration]

Signed-off-by: Ayoub Zaki <ayoub.zaki@embetrix.com>

--- a/pyproject.toml
+++ b/pyproject.toml
@@ -1,3 +1,3 @@
 [build-system]
-requires = ['setuptools>=77.0', 'Cython', "poetry-core>=2.0.0"]
+requires = ['setuptools>=77.0', "poetry-core>=2.0.0"]
 build-backend = "poetry.core.masonry.api"
